\b Topology:\b0  Finder (LOOKUP) -> Safari (MODIFY) -> Screenshot (CREATE) -> Safari (MODIFY) -> Screenshot (CREATE) -> Safari (MODIFY) -> Screenshot (CREATE) -> IntelliJ IDEA (CREATE) -> Finder (CREATE)\par
