\b Request:\b0  To find a data-integrity defect, or produce evidence that updating and deleting one student record does not unintentionally change or remove another record.\par
\par
\b Task Description:\b0\par
1. Review the developer task brief and use Safari to create two synthetic student records with distinct IDs.\par
2. Capture the baseline state, update only the first record, reload Safari, and verify the update persisted while the second record stayed unchanged.\par
3. Delete only the first record, reload Safari, and verify the second record remains unchanged.\par
4. Create a short QA summary in IntelliJ IDEA and compress the screenshots and summary into a single evidence ZIP file in Finder.\par
